    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16134" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσεβ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέβω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ungodly, unholy, profane, sacrilegious,</i> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσεβής,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				132.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				9
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἀσεβῆ,</span> of
			Oedipus, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1382
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1441
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπῶν τί ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.1.16
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν ἀσεβής</span>
			<i>against</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.8.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσεβέστεροι περὶ θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.8.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀλλοτρίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					5.10.5
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βῶς,</span>
			
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					79.9
				</span></i>
